# Copy to ignored vpn.secrets.env only with VPN_TLS=acme-dns (docs/VPN.md § HTTPS). Variables of
# your DNS provider as lego names them (https://go-acme.github.io/lego/dns/), for example:
# CF_DNS_API_TOKEN=...        (cloudflare: token limited to Zone:DNS:Edit of that zone)
# DUCKDNS_TOKEN=...           (duckdns)
# OVH_ENDPOINT=ovh-eu / OVH_APPLICATION_KEY / OVH_APPLICATION_SECRET / OVH_CONSUMER_KEY (ovh)
